# Improve loops = incremental training (always)

This repo’s improve loops are **not one-shot QA**. They are the product’s
**training curriculum**: score → fix → re-score → keep lessons → expand cases.
Agents must treat them as continuous improvement of the app and its functions.

Coverage goal: **every** design element, function, operation, and third-party
connector (Make.com, Supabase edge, GitHub Update assets) belongs in a loop.

## Active loops (own without waiting for re-prompt)

| Domain | Summary path | Runner |
|--------|--------------|--------|
| Whole app / shell | `qa_app/synthetic/improve_summary_latest.json` | `scripts/app_improve_loop.py` |
| Notify / email | `qa_notify/synthetic/improve_summary_latest.json` | `scripts/notify_improve_loop.py` |
| Location / map | `qa_location/synthetic/improve_summary_latest.json` | `scripts/location_improve_loop.py` |
