| Wear OS | `qa_wear/synthetic/improve_summary_latest.json` | `python scripts/improve_loop_runner.py wear` |
| In-app Update | `qa_update/synthetic/improve_summary_latest.json` | `python scripts/improve_loop_runner.py update` |
| Auth / watch-pair / RLS | `qa_auth/synthetic/improve_summary_latest.json` | `python scripts/improve_loop_runner.py auth` |
| Scanner / OCR | `qa_scanner/synthetic/improve_summary_latest.json` | `python scripts/improve_loop_runner.py scanner` |
